{
  "headline": "FDA's records show neostigmine methylsulfate is not on the current shortage list; a prior Fresenius Kabi discontinuation was posted 2026-01-12",
  "headline_cites": ["D3", "E11"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "As of 2026-10-21, neostigmine methylsulfate is not listed on FDA's drug shortage list.",
      "cites": ["D3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA's shortage records show a prior posting for Fresenius Kabi USA, LLC marked \"To Be Discontinued\" with an initial posting date of 2026-01-12.",
      "cites": ["E11"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The product label we have on file names Hikma Pharmaceuticals USA Inc. (FEI 2220525) as the registered manufacturing plant.",
      "cites": ["E10"]
    },
    {
      "text": "That plant's most recent FDA inspection (ID 1237333) ended 2024-06-12 and was classified VAI, with the classification known to FDA on 2024-12-16.",
      "cites": ["E9"]
    },
    {
      "text": "No FDA regulatory action (warning letter, import alert, or OAI classification) is recorded for that plant in the supplied evidence.",
      "cites": ["E3", "E4", "E5", "E6", "E7", "E8", "E9"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East holds 57 vials (0.5 mg/mL, 10 mL) with 15 days on hand at current use; Corvale General holds 109 vials with 28.1 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D1", "D2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The rule‑ranked first option is to buy from Amneal Pharmaceuticals LLC, which is not on FDA's shortage list today; its label names no plant we could place.",
      "cites": ["D4"]
    }
  ]
}
